  ],
  "comments": [
    {
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "comment": "It was grown in minimal mineral medium which contained (per liter of distilled water) KH2PO4 (1.9 g), Na2HPO4 (5.1 g), (NH4)2SO4 (2.0 g), and MgSO4 · 7H2O (0.1 g) at a pH of 7.2. After sterilization, 1 ml of a trace element solution containing (in grams/liter) FeSO4 · 7H2O (1.0), MnSO4 · H2O (1.0), Na2MoO4 · H2O (0.25), H3BO3 (0.10), CuCl2 · H2O (0.25), ZnCl (0.25), NH4VO3 (0.10), Co(NO3)2 · 6H2O (0.25), NiSO4 · 6H2O (0.10), H2SO4 (9.2), and 1 ml of a 25-g/liter solution of Ca(NO3)2 was added to 1 liter of medium. Cultures (1 liter) were grown at 30°C on a rotary shaker (180 rpm) in 5-liter Erlenmeyer flasks sealed with rubber stoppers."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "comment": ""
    },
